---@field SnapshotName aws.kinesis_analytics_v2.SnapshotV2Name The name of the enhanced snapshot. The name must be unique among the snapshots in your account and Region. You can't reuse the name of an existing snapshot, including a snapshot in the FAILED status, until you delete that snapshot. Names that begin with SYSTEMSNAPSHOT are reserved.
---@field ImportSourceConfiguration aws.kinesis_analytics_v2.ImportSourceConfiguration Describes the location, IAM role, and encryption configuration of the savepoint data to import.
---@field DestinationEncryptionConfiguration? aws.kinesis_analytics_v2.SnapshotEncryptionConfiguration The encryption configuration of the imported snapshot. If you don't specify this parameter, the snapshot is encrypted using a key of type AWS_OWNED_KEY. If you specify a KMS key, you must specify the key ARN.
