---@field SnapshotFormat? aws.kinesis_analytics_v2.SnapshotFormat|string The format of the snapshot being imported.
---@field Tags? aws.kinesis_analytics_v2.Tags A list of one or more tags to assign to the snapshot. A tag is a key-value pair that identifies a snapshot. For more information, see Using Tagging.

---@class aws.kinesis_analytics_v2.ImportSnapshotResponse
---@field SnapshotArn aws.kinesis_analytics_v2.SnapshotArn The ARN of the enhanced snapshot.
---@field SnapshotStatus aws.kinesis_analytics_v2.SnapshotStatus The status of the snapshot. When Managed Service for Apache Flink accepts the request, the status is CREATING.
---@field SnapshotOperationId aws.kinesis_analytics_v2.SnapshotOperationId The ID of the snapshot operation. You can use this value with DescribeSnapshotOperation to track the progress of the import.
---@field SnapshotOperationStatus aws.kinesis_analytics_v2.SnapshotOperationStatus The status of the snapshot operation.

